    <tags>empty-directories disk-cleanup sysadmin cli portable windows file-management</tags>
    <summary>Fast, portable empty-directory scanner and cleaner for Windows.</summary>
    <description>
RED++ finds, displays, and deletes empty directories recursively. GUI + headless CLI with filter rules, MFT turbo scan, one-click undo, network/UNC support, and zero installation required.

The release is a self-contained single-file build that bundles the .NET runtime — no runtime to install.

Features:
- Modern WPF and legacy WinForms GUI modes
- Multiple delete modes (Recycle Bin, Direct, Simulate, Move)
- MFT turbo scan for whole-volume scans in seconds (admin required)
- .gitignore support (global, repo, nested)
- One-click undo with multi-run history
- Export to TXT, CSV, JSON, NDJSON, PowerShell script, HTML report
- UNC/network share support with bounded-parallel scan
- Task Scheduler ready with exit codes and saved profiles
- Portable (no install, no registry)
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SysAdminDoc/REDplusplus/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
